\cf4 \cb3   \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  services/building-info-service/index.ts:1 holds >1\uc0\u8239 000 lines covering HTTP setup, caching,\cb1 \
\cb3   Geonorge lookup, Matrikkel SOAP orchestration, building selection and solar/enova integrations,\cb1 \
\cb3   making the core flow impossible to reason about, test or reuse.\cb1 \
\cb3   \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Server modules import browser code and Node primitives interchangeably (services/building-info-\cb1 \
\cb3   service/index.ts:17-30, src/services/csvService.ts:1-4), while the public API is defined in src/\cb1 \
\cb3   api-server.ts:1-152 but compiled runtime paths point at .js files that do not exist when running\cb1 \
\cb3   TypeScript directly.\cb1 \
\cb3   \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Environment handling relies on side-effectful logging and implicit globals (loadEnv.ts:1-\cb1 \
\cb3   18, services/building-info-service/index.ts:36-49), and external calls lack common timeouts/\cb1 \
\cb3   retry/error modelling (services/solar-service/index.js:63-116, src/services/stotteordning-\cb1 \
\cb3   service.ts:27-38).\cb1 \
\cb3   \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  The React shell bundles mock APIs, ad-hoc fetches and feature orchestration into src/\cb1 \
\cb3   App.tsx:26-200, mixing UI state, network calls and animation toggles without separation, which\cb1 \
\cb3   blocks reuse (Figma vs. wizard) and automated testing.\cb1 \
\cb3   \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Critical data sources (CSV cache, st\'f8tteordninger JSON, Python scripts) are loaded\cb1 \
\cb3   synchronously at runtime without lifecycle management (src/services/csvService.ts:15-70, src/api-\cb1 \
\cb3   server.ts:61-90), leading to blocking startup, unclear refresh strategy and no validation.\cb1 \
\cb3   \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Deploy og drift er ikke tilpasset Marvin: applikasjonen forventer .env-filer og lokal ts-node\cb1 \
\cb3   kj\'f8ring, mangler GitOps-struktur for ArgoCD/ApplicationSet, har ingen kobling til External\cb1 \
\cb3   Secrets/Key Vault, og dokumenterer ikke egress-behov for Squid/Zero-Trust-krav.\cb1 \
